n\",\"content\":\"The power tools market in the United States is expected to reach a projected revenue of US$ 15,043.4 million by 2033. A compound annual growth rate of 9.3% is expected of the United States power tools market from 2026 to 2033.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.grandviewresearch.com/horizon/featured_og_regional/power-tools-market-united-states.webp\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"https://cdn.grandviewresearch.online/horizon/images/horizon_ico.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L1f\",\"19\",{}]]\n"])</script><script type="6714355c3ddf373827e2b857-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"20:I[827055,[\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/0zhbw0syep9h_.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/3_nwh7t9td19l.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/2_qamwxz8x7oi.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/05tbhcuewqul_.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/1n_dbdbadkfla.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/33y1_t-ordgsz.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/25aq9elj221h8.js\",\"/horizon/_next/static/chunks/0aq-efd8k7749.js\"],\"default\"]\n21:T7aa,"])</script><script type="6714355c3ddf373827e2b857-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003ch2\u003eU.S. power tools market highlights\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe U.S. power tools market generated a revenue of USD 7,541.4 million in 2025 and is expected to reach USD 15,043.4 million by 2033.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe U.S. market is expected to grow at a CAGR of 9.3% from 2026 to 2033.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIn terms of segment, drills was the largest revenue generating product in 2025.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDrills is the most lucrative product segment registering the fastest growth during the forecast period.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePower tools market data book summary\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 7,541.4 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 15,043.4 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGrowth rate\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e9.3% (CAGR from 2026 to 2033)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLargest segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFastest growing segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eHistorical data\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2021 - 2024\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBase year\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eForecast period\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2026 - 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eQuantitative units\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRevenue in USD million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket segmentation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills, Saws, Wrenches, Grinders, Sanders\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKey market players worldwide\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eEmerson Electric Co, Ingersoll Rand Inc, Hitachi Ltd, Makita Corp, Robert Bosch Engineering \u0026amp; Business Solutions, Stanley Black \u0026amp; Decker, Techtronic Industries Co Ltd\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOther key industry trends\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul class=\"second_ul\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 21.7% of the global power tools market in 2025.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCountry-wise, China is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn North America, U.S. power tools market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eU.S. is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 15,043.4 million by 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr\u003e"])</script><script type="6714355c3ddf373827e2b857-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"22:T537,{\"header\": [\"Product\", 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024, 2025, 2026, 2027, 2028, 2029, 2030, 2031, 2032, 2033, \"CAGR\"], \"data\": [[\"Drills\", \"2177.52\", \"2223.73\", \"2296.75\", \"2404.65\", \"2558.91\", \"2776.05\", \"3080.32\", \"3419.38\", \"3796.27\", \"4208.17\", \"4667.75\", \"5178.02\", \"5735.26\", \"10.92%\"], [\"Saws\", \"1702.50\", \"1691.23\", \"1699.15\", \"1730.48\", \"1791.29\", \"1890.33\", \"2040.34\", \"2203.44\", \"2380.00\", \"2566.85\", \"2770.24\", \"2990.10\", \"3222.51\", \"7.92%\"], [\"Wrenches\", \"495.48\", \"503.75\", \"517.99\", \"539.92\", \"572.00\", \"617.79\", \"682.46\", \"754.36\", \"834.02\", \"920.76\", \"1017.28\", \"1124.12\", \"1240.40\", \"10.47%\"], [\"Grinders\", \"759.80\", \"759.79\", \"768.43\", \"787.80\", \"820.91\", \"872.05\", \"947.52\", \"1030.23\", \"1120.52\", \"1217.05\", \"1322.96\", \"1438.47\", \"1561.90\", \"8.68%\"], [\"Sanders\", \"696.17\", \"701.48\", \"714.88\", \"738.51\", \"775.43\", \"830.05\", \"908.77\", \"995.75\", \"1091.40\", \"1194.63\", \"1308.73\", \"1434.15\", \"1569.47\", \"9.53%\"], [\"Others\", \"988.81\", \"979.81\", \"980.85\", \"994.15\", \"1022.90\", \"1071.55\", \"1146.53\", \"1228.06\", \"1314.95\", \"1405.44\", \"1502.68\", \"1606.30\", \"1713.83\", \"6.94%\"], [\"Total\", \"6820.28\", \"6859.79\", \"6978.05\", \"7195.51\", \"7541.44\", \"8057.82\", \"8805.94\", \"9631.22\", \"10537.16\", \"11512.90\", \"12589.64\", \"13771.16\", \"15043.37\", \"9.33%\"]], \"tableName\": \"U.S. power tools market statistics, by product, 2021-2033 (USD Million)\"}23:T4af,{\"title\": {\"text\": \"U.S. power tools market statistics, b