3e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePower tools market data book summary\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 7,541.4 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket revenue in 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eUSD 15,043.4 million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGrowth rate\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e9.3% (CAGR from 2026 to 2033)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLargest segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eFastest growing segment\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eHistorical data\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2021 - 2024\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eBase year\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2025\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eForecast period\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003e2026 - 2033\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eQuantitative units\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRevenue in USD million\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMarket segmentation\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eDrills, Saws, Wrenches, Grinders, Sanders\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eKey market players worldwide\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eEmerson Electric Co, Ingersoll Rand Inc, Hitachi Ltd, Makita Corp, Robert Bosch Engineering \u0026amp; Business Solutions, Stanley Black \u0026amp; Decker, Techtronic Industries Co Ltd\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eOther key industry trends\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul class=\"second_ul\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn terms of revenue, U.S. accounted for 21.7% of the global power tools market in 2025.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCountry-wise, China is expected to lead the global market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIn North America, U.S. power tools market is projected to lead the regional market in terms of revenue in 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eU.S. is the fastest growing regional market in North America and is projected to reach USD 15,043.4 million by 2033.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"])</script><script type="6714355c3ddf373827e2b857-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"25:T54a,{\"header\":[\"Product\",2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026,2027,2028,2029,2030,\"CAGR\"],\"data\":[[\"Engine\",\"189467.62\",\"195563.12\",\"159886.61\",\"181808.61\",\"191709.91\",\"197977.76\",\"204754.50\",\"211991.17\",\"219741.53\",\"228020.63\",\"236865.79\",\"246425.17\",\"256600.36\",\"3.83%\"],[\"Aircrafts Manufacturing\",\"460594.74\",\"473364.00\",\"387632.05\",\"441368.04\",\"463317.05\",\"476597.22\",\"490902.25\",\"506170.28\",\"522530.06\",\"540028.68\",\"558760.49\",\"578938.98\",\"600549.61\",\"3.42%\"],[\"Cabin Interiors\",\"76249.75\",\"79505.51\",\"65224.44\",\"74619.49\",\"79392.79\",\"82891.27\",\"86693.06\",\"90787.04\",\"95204.04\",\"99962.44\",\"105087.64\",\"110592.06\",\"116580.70\",\"5.06%\"],[\"Equipment, Safety \u0026 Support\",\"48792.95\",\"51302.69\",\"42338.35\",\"48717.71\",\"52237.15\",\"55038.57\",\"58094.86\",\"61415.09\",\"65025.40\",\"68945.53\",\"73213.54\",\"77840.54\",\"82922.03\",\"6.11%\"],[\"Avionics\",\"80979.94\",\"85185.86\",\"71528.08\",\"83461.38\",\"89515.06\",\"94325.39\",\"99526.79\",\"105136.63\",\"111182.97\",\"117746.77\",\"124814.75\",\"132340.81\",\"140740.44\",\"5.94%\"],[\"Insulation Components\",\"20852.44\",\"22278.91\",\"18572.79\",\"21553.76\",\"23305.35\",\"24659.16\",\"26076.44\",\"27545.29\",\"29098.65\",\"30668.68\",\"32337.64\",\"34109.62\",\"35848.20\",\"5.45%\"],[\"Total\",\"876937.44\",\"907200.09\",\"745182.32\",\"851528.99\",\"899477.31\",\"931489.37\",\"966047.90\",\"1003045.50\",\"1042782.65\",\"1085372.73\",\"1131079.85\",\"1180